{
  "title": "ISic001342. Fragment of a funerary inscription",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΗΙΑΚ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΒΥΤΗ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν]</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτ(η)</span>  <span data-text=\"ο\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ο\">ο</span>´ <span data-text=\"μῆνας\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"μείς\">μῆ(νας)</span>  <span data-text=\"θ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"θ\">θ</span>´[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\"> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] ΗΙΑΚ [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span> ] ΒΥΤΗ [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span> ] <span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτη</span>  <span data-text=\"ο\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ο\">ο</span>  <span data-text=\"μῆνας\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"μείς\">μῆνας</span>  <span data-text=\"θ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"θ\">θ</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΗΙΑΚ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΒΥΤΗ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">......]</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤ</span><span data-text=\"ο\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ο\">Ο</span><span data-text=\"μῆνας\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"μείς\">ΜΗ</span><span data-text=\"θ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"θ\">Θ</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΗΙΑΚ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]ΒΥΤΗ[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ζῶ\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"ο\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"ο\">Ο</span><span data-text=\"μῆνας\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"μείς\">ΜΗΝΑΣ</span><span data-text=\"θ\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"θ\">Θ</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span class=\"lines 2-3\">lines.2-3: <span>πρεσ]βύτη[ς ἔζησεν] ἔτ(η) ο μῆ(νας) θ CIG III 5732a; ἔζησεν] ἔτ(η) ο μῆ(νας) θ IG XIV 522</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>… lived 70 years and 8 months …</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The funerary inscription is too fragmentary to allow a secure reconstruction. However, l. 3 may preserve a reference to the age of the deceased expressed by means of numerals, which are also abbreviated in the funerary inscriptions from Catania (cf. IG XIV 484; IG XIV 525).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Gualtherus 1624 [1625] 49 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931</a>  </li><li> Franz 1853 5732a <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250</a>  </li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">522</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
